OL,3,GNEWSAHow a village used boulders to
OL,4,Abeat antisocial behaviour
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrug dealing, car racing, late-night
OL,7,Fgatherings and people having sex in
OL,8,Fpublic are issues that have plagued Mow
OL,9,FCop for decades.
OL,11,FNow the problems for the village on the
OL,12,FStaffordshire-Cheshire border have
OL,13,Fsuddenly stopped thanks to a very
OL,14,Fsimple - but unauthorised - solution.
OL,16,FBoulders and rubble have been dropped
OL,17,Finto three laybys, which have attracted
OL,18,Fthe anti-social behaviour for years, so
OL,19,Fpeople can no longer park in them.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
