OL,3,GNEWSAHow a village used boulders to
OL,4,Abeat antisocial behaviour
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move on Congleton Road, which was
OL,7,Ffirst taken in March, has proved
OL,8,Fcontroversial but John Cliffe, who
OL,9,Flives nearby, said: "It looks a mess,
OL,10,Fbut it's quite effective, it's stopped
OL,11,Fthe anti-social behaviour."
